# Read by the Cloudflare Worker (static assets), never served (decision 188).
# Cross-origin isolation lets Chrome run the wasm renderer on several threads;
# without it the same build still runs, on one. What the app loads from
# another origin is fetched with CORS (Supabase) or sends
# Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin (checked 27 September 2026:
# Google's sign-in script, Firebase's SDK, fonts.gstatic.com); the renderer
# is now served from here.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
